      "side": 1,
      "message": "Be explicit about what `it` references in `it\u0027s`. Also mention that we only record the entry, but no need to fetch the timestamp?\n\nI actually don\u0027t understand what\u0027s happening here? Are we ignoring methods that make calls?",
      "range": {
